  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "GoTube: Scalable Stochastic Veriﬁcation of Continuous-Depth Models",
      "bbox": [
        91.38300323486328,
        98.98509216308594,
        520.6215209960938,
        111.88232421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sophie Gruenbacher 1* , Mathias Lechner 2, Ramin Hasani 3,",
      "bbox": [
        152.85800170898438,
        130.5909423828125,
        462.1308288574219,
        143.9156951904297
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Daniela Rus 3, Thomas A. Henzinger 2, Scott A. Smolka 4, Radu Grosu 1",
      "bbox": [
        124.28204345703125,
        145.49481201171875,
        487.2181396484375,
        157.8636932373047
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Abstract",
      "bbox": [
        154.71502685546875,
        219.08888244628906,
        191.78587341308594,
        228.04525756835938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We introduce a new stochastic veriﬁcation algorithm that",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        236.6788330078125,
        282.5368957519531,
        244.69479370117188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "formally quantiﬁes the behavioral robustness of any time-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        246.64080810546875,
        282.5369873046875,
        254.65676879882812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "continuous process formulated as a continuous-depth model.",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        256.60382080078125,
        282.5369873046875,
        264.6197814941406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our algorithm solves a set of global optimization (Go) prob-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        266.56683349609375,
        282.5369567871094,
        274.5827941894531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "lems over a given time horizon to construct a tight enclosure",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        276.5288391113281,
        282.5369567871094,
        284.5447998046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(Tube) of the set of all process executions starting from a",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        286.4918518066406,
        282.53692626953125,
        294.5078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ball of initial states. We call our algorithm GoTube. Through",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        296.4548645019531,
        282.5369873046875,
        304.4708251953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "its construction, GoTube ensures that the bounding tube is",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        306.4168701171875,
        282.5369567871094,
        314.4328308105469
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "conservative up to a desired probability and up to a desired",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        316.3798828125,
        282.53692626953125,
        324.3958435058594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tightness. GoTube is implemented in JAX and optimized to",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        326.3428955078125,
        282.53692626953125,
        334.3588562011719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "scale to complex continuous-depth neural network models.",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        336.3049011230469,
        282.53692626953125,
        344.32086181640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Compared to advanced reachability analysis tools for time-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        346.2679138183594,
        282.5368957519531,
        354.28387451171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "continuous neural networks, GoTube does not accumulate",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        356.2309265136719,
        282.53692626953125,
        364.24688720703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "overapproximation errors between time steps and avoids the",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        366.19293212890625,
        282.536865234375,
        374.2088928222656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "infamous wrapping effect inherent in symbolic techniques.",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        376.15594482421875,
        282.5369567871094,
        384.1719055175781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We show that GoTube substantially outperforms state-of-the-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        386.1179504394531,
        282.5368957519531,
        394.1339111328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "art veriﬁcation tools in terms of the size of the initial ball,",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        396.0809631347656,
        282.5368957519531,
        404.096923828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "speed, time-horizon, task completion, and scalability on a",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        406.0439758300781,
        282.5369567871094,
        414.0599365234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "large set of experiments. GoTube is stable and sets the state-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        416.0059814453125,
        282.5368957519531,
        424.0219421386719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of-the-art in terms of its ability to scale to time horizons well",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        425.968994140625,
        282.53692626953125,
        433.9849548339844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "beyond what has been previously possible.",
      "bbox": [
        63.96302795410156,
        435.9320068359375,
        217.010498046875,
        443.9479675292969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Introduction",
      "bbox": [
        140.81002807617188,
        461.12615966796875,
        205.69090270996094,
        471.8738708496094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The use of deep-learning systems powered by continu-",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        476.41259765625,
        292.504638671875,
        485.31915283203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ous-depth models continues to grow, especially due to the",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        487.37060546875,
        292.504638671875,
        496.27716064453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "revival of neural ordinary differential equations (Neural",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        498.32958984375,
        292.5046691894531,
        507.23614501953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ODEs) (Chen et al. 2018). These models parametrize the",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        509.28857421875,
        292.5046081542969,
        518.1951293945312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "derivative of the hidden states by a neural network. The re-",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        520.24755859375,
        292.5046691894531,
        529.1541137695312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "sulting system of differential equations can perform strong",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        531.20654296875,
        292.50469970703125,
        540.1130981445312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "function approximation and generative modeling. Ensuring",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        542.16552734375,
        292.5046081542969,
        551.0720825195312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "their safety and robustness in any of these fronts is a ma-",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        553.1245727539062,
        292.50469970703125,
        562.0311279296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "jor imperative, particularly in high-stakes decision-making",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        564.0835571289062,
        292.5046691894531,
        572.9901123046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "applications such as medicine, automation, and ﬁnance.",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        575.0425415039062,
        275.6379699707031,
        583.9490966796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A particularly appealing approach is to construct a tight",
      "bbox": [
        63.96303176879883,
        586.0015869140625,
        292.5050048828125,
        594.9081420898438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "overapproximation of the set of states reached over time ac-",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        596.9595947265625,
        292.5046691894531,
        605.8661499023438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "cording to the neural network’s dynamics (a bounding tube)",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        607.9185791015625,
        292.5046081542969,
        616.8251342773438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and provide deterministic or stochastic guarantees for the",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
        618.8775634765625,
        292.5046691894531,
        627.7841186523438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "conservativeness of the tube’s bounds.",
      "bbox": [
        54.000030517578125,
